WEBVTT

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.120
Thank you for waiting.
Here is your Darjeeling.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:16.950
Three Mont Blancs
and melt-in-mouth puddings...

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.950
--Four puddings.
--Oh, sorry about that.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.830
Don't worry about it.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.910
Thank you!

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:36.500
Cacao, you know what? I made
pancakes with my mom the other day!

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.660
--They're good friends now.
--It was super fluffy and delicious.
We're going to do it again soon!

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:43.080
--The shop is doing well, too. Good business.
--It was super fluffy and delicious.
We're going to do it again soon!

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:20.620
♪ What's for dinner tonight?! ♪

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.870
Whoa! It's seared tuna!

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.080
Yay!

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:29.950
Delicious!

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:32.790
Hey! What did I tell you about
stealing a bite before dinner?!

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:36.370
--Oh...
--Are you sure you're ready for the renewal?

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:37.500
Renewal?

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.700
I got the notification
for renewing your bell.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.500
Renewing the... bell?

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.660
Remember you got certified to wear your bell?

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.830
Yes! Chocola is a great cat
who earned her bell!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:53.040
Yes, and now you have
to take a test to renew it.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.870
Last time we took the test, I remember
someone mentioning the need to renew.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.910
--Huh...?
--Human society changes all the time.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:04.000
They have to make sure
you're adapting, I suppose.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:08.120
What if we don't pass the test?

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.660
Your bell is revoked.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:13.500
No, no, no, no!

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:19.250
No, no, no, no...

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.580
You, too, Vanilla?

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.540
Thanks! Chocola will be fine.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.370
We just have to pass the test, that's all.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.830
What's a bell?

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:40.660
Huh?

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:44.120
We never explained it properly to Cacao.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.290
Oh, right.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:50.580
You see, cats without a bell can't
walk around outside without a human.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:55.500
If you get caught,
who knows what they'll do to you...

00:03:56.160 --> 00:04:01.040
But if a cat is wearing a bell,
the cat can go out alone.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:04.160
The bell means the cat can successfully
navigate within human society.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:08.160
You take a test,
and if you pass, you get a bell!

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:13.330
You're tested on your knowledge
of human rules and norms,

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.370
whether you're able to resist
feline instincts and urges,

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:20.000
and whether you're able
to behave rationally.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:26.790
And! Chocola and Vanilla are great cats
who passed the test in one go!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:29.370
Hmm? Do you want a bell, too, Cacao?

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:30.500
Yes.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:35.950
You're still small.
You're not old enough to take the test.

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:39.290
Let's go get you one
as soon as you're a bit older.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.620
I see.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:47.540
Let's hope you can get that bell soon!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.410
Yes...

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:51.500
When you get a bell,
let's go out together!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.790
Thank you for waiting.
Here is your strawberry shortcake.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.040
Thank you.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.410
Enjoy.

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.500
Oh, no! I-I'm so sorry!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:08.620
I-I'll get a towel right away...

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.370
--Are you okay?
--There's no rush.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:14.370
I'm sorry... So sorry...

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.330
Let's train.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.700
--Now what kind of cat
will we be visiting today?

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:19.790
--Train?
--Now what kind of cat
will we be visiting today?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.370
--At this rate, there's a risk
we could fail the bell renewal test.
--Now what kind of cat
will we be visiting today?

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:23.370
--At this rate, there's a risk
we could fail the bell renewal test.
--I've been told that the cat's name is Bob
and they bring happiness.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:25.910
--Huh? We'll be fine.
--I've been told that the cat's name is Bob
and they bring happiness.

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:31.000
Chocola is a great cat who passed
the test in one shot after all!

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.250
Then how about this?

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.040
Chocola can't help it--Chocola is a cat!

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:41.200
Okay, Cacao, then.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:47.200
Cacao can do it.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.620
Oh, no...

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:52.620
Chocola, you need to show that
you're a big sister who can do it right.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:57.250
You don't want to fail the test
and lose your bell, do you?

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.290
Right...

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:01.250
Then let's do this. I'll accompany you.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:05.580
Got it! Chocola will do her best!

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.160
And so...

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:12.830
Help us, teachers!

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:14.450
I get it!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.950
You can count on us.

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:19.080
Rest easy--we've got this.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:21.330
So let's start with...

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.790
Yeah!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.160
Go!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.750
Chocola, stretch out the wrinkles.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.160
Sorry...

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:47.080
The kitchen is a warzone.
There's no room for tears!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.500
So hot...

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:57.540
They say, keep a cool head,
and even fire can feel cool.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:07:01.250
Hot is hot. There's no way to deny that!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.620
Fight on! You're almost done!

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:04.910
But...

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.200
You can have ice cream when you're done!

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:09.830
Ice cream?!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.040
Delicious!

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:16.370
So tired.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.790
Ice cream after training is great.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:20.830
Training?

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.910
Yes, training!

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:26.870
Were we... actually training?

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.410
Oh!

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:30.160
Were we perhaps...

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:33.540
...just helping with chores...?

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.370
Well, so, um...

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:41.500
It's not what it seems.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:45.450
We just wanted to see how well you can do...

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:47.250
How about some tea?

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:53.160
We'll do proper training, too! Here.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.500
I anticipated that this would happen...

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.450
"Bell Exam - Book of Secrets"
So I prepared this!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:58.870
That's...!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.250
What is that?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:05.450
--Hey.
--This is the "Bell Manual - Book of Secrets."

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:09.080
It's a textbook to prepare you
for the bell test.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.450
Ah.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:13.250
Don't you remember?
We used it last time.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:20.160
Huh? Oh, of course! Come on, let's train!

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:24.660
Secret number one! Check the door
when leaving the house!

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:28.330
First, you must perfectly learn
the rules of human society.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:31.410
When leaving the house,
lock the door properly.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.450
Yes.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.450
--Check!
--Check!

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.870
Secret number six! Obey traffic laws.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.620
Look right, look left.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:49.910
Good.

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:55.200
Azuki-<i>sensei</i>!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:56.370
Yes, Miss Chocola?

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:58.290
Why do we raise our hands
when we cross the street?

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:03.500
Good question. It's to make us
more visible to drivers.

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:04.580
Ah.

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:10.870
However, the National Public Safety
Commission no longer recommends this.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:12.450
Huh.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:16.000
Secret number ten! Learn to ride the train.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.540
Nice dive.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:27.910
That's wrong, Cacao! Watch Chocola do it.

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:31.330
Touch the pass on this machine
and move through quickly--

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:37.370
Not having enough money in the pass or not
touching the machine properly can lead to death.

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.290
Welcome home!

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.200
All right, my training is super realistic!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.500
Vanilla, you're out!

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:09.620
Secret number 15!
Don't enter random boxes.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:24.290
Secret number 21.
Always keep your cool and stay calm.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:25.500
Come on...

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.750
Are you sure you're okay like that?

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.330
Are you sure you're okay like that?

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:35.620
I'm not the one taking the test!

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:39.330
Ahem. Anyway, next.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:43.290
Secret number 28!
Control your instincts.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:49.700
Don't react instinctively.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:52.660
I am not easily tempted by such things.

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:55.700
No chewing your nails either!

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:01.540
No punching holes in the paper doors, okay?

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.250
Resist, resist.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:14.040
See? Even if another cat does it
right in front of you, you have to resist.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.620
Shigure-<i>sama</i>?! No, this isn't...

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.870
I mean, this is training, and...

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:38.950
Cinammon-<i>sensei</i>'s intellectual
and elegant training begins!

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:45.200
Secret number 39!
Don't accept things from strangers!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:49.450
I'll play the stranger role,
so let's practice, okay?

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:51.040
--Yes.
--Understood.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.750
You girls want a snack?

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:04.200
That's not so much a stranger, but...

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.700
More like a pervert.

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:12.160
Secret number 45!
Learn your toilet etiquette.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.250
Let me check.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.040
No, thanks.

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:24.080
Secret number 50!
Study hard.

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:29.450
You see? Flowers have
a pistil and a stamen.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:33.540
The se... I mean, pollen from the stamen...

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:39.500
Inseminate... I mean, pollinates the pistil.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.250
Then a baby...

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.580
Cinnamon.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.790
That's quite enough of that.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:49.080
What?! But I'm not even moist yet!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.830
What are you even doing?

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.540
Maple-<i>sensei</i>!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:56.200
Looks like it's my turn.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:13:00.910
Secret number 63!
Learn to go shopping.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:04.250
Vanilla, please get some milk.
Chocola, you can get granulated sugar.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:05.250
Got it!

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.540
Understood.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:11.040
Hmm? Cacao, can you help, too?

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:14.660
Okay, in that case,
can you get some mayonnaise?

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:15.830
Yes.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.040
"Open 24 hours"

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.910
Milk, milk...

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.660
"Dried fish"

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.620
That was fast.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.620
Here you are!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:33.330
"Nyao Nyull Premium"

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.750
"Nyao Nyull Premium"
Huh? I asked for granulated sugar.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:41.250
Master always says
Cacao is allowed to buy one snack!

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:45.290
You should learn from Cacao.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:49.160
Oh...

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:55.580
Secret number 82. Don't climb to
a place you can't come down from.

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:58.830
I'll show an example, okay?

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:03.410
S-See? I can't come down...

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.120
Wow.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:19.250
Impressive, Cacao!

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:23.540
Secret number 90.
Learn to get vaccinated with a smile.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:31.910
That's not... possible!

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:34.870
"Meow the Hospital"
"Vaccinations available"

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:41.330
All right, let's do a tough one for the end!

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:47.120
Secret number 99.
Don't be afraid of water.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:54.200
Chocola loves baths!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.450
I know.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.450
I'm very tired.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:02.250
But after all that training,
we're sure to pass the test!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.330
It's okay.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.370
Don't be afraid.

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:09.200
See? The duck is swimming, too.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.410
That's great, at such a young age.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:16.580
Yes, she's great.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.160
Hopefully, Cacao can take the test soon, too.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:22.450
She will pass in one go.

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.950
Yes! Cacao is a genius!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.330
"Unaccompanied Activities
License Renewal Examinations"

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.660
Chocola, Vanilla, are you both ready?

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:47.830
We're ready, Shigure-<i>chan</i>!

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.870
Impressive, Vanilla.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.620
Yes, I am.

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.200
But you know what? Tickle, tickle!

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:09.750
This is what happens when Chocola does it.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:12.660
That's because it's Chocola.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.660
Well, best of luck to both of you.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.540
Yes, this is exact.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.950
Thank you.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.200
They should have started right about now.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.660
I hope they pass.

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:33.620
Vanilla should be fine, but Chocola
is a risk. She's super clumsy.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:37.750
I agree. She always causes so much trouble...

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:42.290
But she's too innocent to get mad at.

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:43.370
True.

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.500
Cacao.

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:58.330
Don't do that. You'll never get a bell that way.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.790
Shigure-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.040
We passed!

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.160
Congratulations.

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:10.450
Of course, Chocola is a bona fide great cat!

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:12.950
To be honest, I was worried about you.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.160
Oh?

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.410
Another miracle.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:21.080
As a sort of celebration,
shall we go someplace fun?

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:22.580
Yay!

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.120
In that case, we can go see an aurora...

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:29.290
Or perhaps a visit to the moon
can be an option...

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:33.660
They passed!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.000
Great!

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.080
I was worried.

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:40.830
I'm so glad my effort to teach
them things paid off!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.950
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:46.870
Um...

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.790
"Changing now"
We kind of get it.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.450
"Changing now"
Say no more.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:52.620
"Changing now"

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.580
"Kinryuzan"
"Kaminarimon"

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:55.870
Wow...

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:57.620
So big!

00:17:57.620 --> 00:18:00.290
Look, look! It's so high!

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:05.290
--No, that's not it.
--Huh?

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:08.120
Don't drink directly.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:11.200
Cleanse your hand, put the water in there,
and then rinse out your mouth.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:12.750
Ah.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.700
"Omikuji
100 yen"

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.790
Oh, no!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.620
"Souvenir Kaminari Okoshi"
"Kaminari Manju" "Kaminari Okoshi"
"Kaminari Okoshi Gift Set"

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.290
"Asakusa Round Yokan"
"Peach Sweet Mochi Cake" "Good Fortune Manju"
"Chestnut Paste Daifuku" "Daimon Cooked Mochi"

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:29.290
So many different shops!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.120
--In the future we can have
a Soleil branch here...

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:32.540
--Souvenir.
--In the future we can have
a Soleil branch here...

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.830
Oh, for Chiyo-<i>chan</i>?

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:36.870
That would be nice.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:40.000
We should get something
for the master and the others.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.000
Yeah, let's!

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:47.160
Hmm, but which one?

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:52.750
--What's that?
--They told me a wooden sword
is a standard souvenir.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:54.250
Ah.

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.660
That's odd.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:56.750
Have you decided?

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:59.250
Well, not yet...

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:01.660
"Kaminari Okoshi"
"Ningyoyaki"
Why so many?!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.700
"Kaminari Okoshi"
"Ningyoyaki"
It's for my dearest brother
and my dearest cats!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.910
"Potato Yokan from Imocho"
"Kaminari Okoshi"
I would buy much more if I could!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.370
Can we carry all that back...?

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:13.160
We'll need to use White Cat Nyamato's
Parcel Delivery Service.

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:14.290
"Octopus" "Gizzard shad"
"Squid" "Sweet Shrimp"

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.160
"Yellow jack" "Tuna"
"Fatty tuna" "Medium-fatty tuna"

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:16.120
"Bonito" "Tuna and onion"
"Yellowtail" "Conger eel"

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:23.160
So many fishes coming my way...

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:26.040
Take anything you like.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.830
--Anything?!
--Are you sure?!

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:31.830
--Yes.
--Thank you, Shigure-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:33.250
Hey, Chocola!

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:35.000
What are you doing?!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:40.410
You have to take the whole plate.
The textbook said so.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.540
Really?

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:48.200
You got your bell, please live up to it.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.330
Yes.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:52.450
Let's eat.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:53.660
Let's.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:20.160
Boy, we ate a lot!

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:21.660
Thank you.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.040
Did you like it?

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:24.000
Yes.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.750
I'm glad.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:30.370
So, what's next?
Anywhere else you'd like to visit?

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.160
About that...

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.700
Chocola would like to visit a café.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:35.950
A café?

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:40.580
Yes. By studying another café,
maybe we can help make the master's store

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.500
much better than it is now.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.450
That's a wonderful idea!

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:47.870
That's my Chocola.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:52.660
Know thyself and know others
and do not fear a hundred battles.

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:58.620
Let's go right away!
We'll go for as long as time allows!

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:00.540
"Akihabara Purchase-Only"

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:04.540
There!

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:06.790
Moé, moé!

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:07.830
Kyun!

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:09.830
Excuse me!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.040
Welcome home, Master.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:22.290
Clang, clang, clang, clang...

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:25.370
--Clang, clang, clang...
--Clang, clang, clang...

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:21.870
"Illustrated by Henreader"
"Please watch again!"
